//   `SDL_PROP_PROCESS_CREATE_STDERR_TO_STDOUT_BOOLEAN`: true if the error output of the process
//   should be redirected into the standard output of the process. This property has no effect if
//   `SDL_PROP_PROCESS_CREATE_STDERR_NUMBER` is set. - `SDL_PROP_PROCESS_CREATE_BACKGROUND_BOOLEAN`:
